        "FC-S-be45df6ef11313b3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-80c6ec1cbc3e9a46",
      "text": "In contrast, unmodified LNPs delivered mRNA to fewer than 20% of target BMDMs in vitro (Fig.",
