      "text": "By transfecting target cells with luciferase, we quantified the killing effect, and the results demonstrated that the CAR-M derived from αCD163/LNP-FAPCAR significantly eliminated the FAP+JS-1 target cells in vitro (Fig.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "GP-008-FC-a5c6681cff08ce5b",
      "text": "Both αCD163/LNP-FAPCAR and LNP-FAPCAR treatments significantly enhanced the phagocytic rates of BMDMs.",
      "source_ids": [
        "FC-S-5f7e3c49e57be4bb"
      ]
